    ogc:problem "After R-32 the assembly performed two actions side by side, the contracting lifecycle and the evaluation, with the handoff stated only in prose. SysML can nest: an action usage typed by another action def is a black box with defined inputs and outputs, and that action def is its drill-down, conforming to the interface above by typing. Z asked whether OpenSysML gives us that power and, if so, to make it the way the two layers are modeled." ;
