ogc:synthetic a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:comment "true on a record and on each of its members when the content is synthetic (sheet 10-43, R-50): the worked example is a synthetic case whose names recognise the roles of real people (R-23); the tool prints the tag and the explorer can filter on it" ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

